WEBVTT

00:06:57.250 --> 00:07:00.682
Want to join me?

00:07:00.682 --> 00:07:02.345
Thank you.

00:07:02.345 --> 00:07:07.644
(Applause)

00:07:07.644 --> 00:07:11.100
June Cohen: So Isabel —
IA: Thank you.

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:14.461
JC: First of all,

00:07:14.461 --> 00:07:17.210
I never like to presume to
speak for the TED community,

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:19.388
but I would like to tell you that I have a feeling

00:07:19.388 --> 00:07:21.222
we can all agree that you are still charming,

00:07:21.222 --> 00:07:23.191
seductive and sexy. Yes?

00:07:23.191 --> 00:07:25.686
IA: Aww, thank you.
(Applause)

00:07:25.686 --> 00:07:28.172
JC: Hands down.
IA: No, it's makeup.

00:07:28.172 --> 00:07:29.612
Moderator: Now, would it be awkward

00:07:29.612 --> 00:07:32.132
if I asked you a follow-up question
about your erotic fantasies?